"""Year 3: al-Shama'il al-Muhammadiyyah of Imam al-Tirmidhi, question by question. Written for Ihsan from well-known
narrations in the collection; marked for a teacher to check."""
Q = [
("His height","How tall was the Prophet ﷺ?","Of medium height: neither very tall nor short. Anas رضي الله عنه described him as of middle stature."),
("His hair","How did Anas رضي الله عنه describe the Prophet's ﷺ hair?","Neither tightly curled nor completely straight, but slightly wavy."),
("His hair","How long was the Prophet's ﷺ hair?","It reached about his earlobes, and at times down to his shoulders."),
("His grey hairs","How many white hairs did the Prophet ﷺ have when he passed away?","Very few: fewer than twenty white hairs in his head and beard."),
("His complexion","What was the Prophet's ﷺ complexion?","Fair and radiant, not stark white and not dark."),
("His face","How did al-Bara' رضي الله عنه describe the Prophet's ﷺ face?","When asked whether it was like a sword, he said no: it was like the moon."),
("The seal","Where was the seal of prophethood?","Between his shoulders, nearer the left shoulder blade."),
("The seal","What did the seal of prophethood look like?","A raised piece of flesh about the size of a pigeon's egg, like the button of a canopy."),
("His walk","How did the Prophet ﷺ walk?","Briskly and firmly, leaning slightly forward, as if coming down a slope."),
("His turning","How did the Prophet ﷺ turn to someone?","He turned his whole body towards them, not just his head."),
("His clothes","Which garment did the Prophet ﷺ love most?","The qamis (long shirt)."),
("His clothes","Which colour of clothing did he encourage?","White: wear white, for it is purer and better, and shroud your dead in it."),
("His ring","What was the Prophet's ﷺ ring made of?","Silver."),
("His ring","What was engraved on the ring, and how?","'Muhammad Rasul Allah' in three lines: Muhammad on one line, Rasul on one line, Allah on one line."),
("His ring","Why did the Prophet ﷺ have a ring made?","To seal his letters to kings, because he was told they would only accept a sealed letter."),
("His sandals","What were the Prophet's ﷺ sandals like?","They had two straps."),
("His bread","What bread did the Prophet's ﷺ family usually eat?","Barley bread, and his family did not eat their fill of it two days in a row."),
("Condiments","Which condiment did the Prophet ﷺ praise?","Vinegar: 'What an excellent condiment vinegar is.'"),
("Olive oil","What did the Prophet ﷺ say about olive oil?","Eat olive oil and rub it on your bodies, for it comes from a blessed tree."),
("Meat","Which part of the meat did the Prophet ﷺ like?","The shoulder (foreleg)."),
("Pumpkin","Which vegetable did the Prophet ﷺ like, according to Anas رضي الله عنه?","Pumpkin (gourd). Anas رضي الله عنه saw him picking it out from the dish."),
("Sweets","What sweet things did the Prophet ﷺ love?","Sweets and honey."),
("Eating","How many fingers did the Prophet ﷺ eat with?","Three fingers, and he would lick them after eating."),
("Eating","Did the Prophet ﷺ eat while reclining?","No. He said: 'As for me, I do not eat while reclining.'"),
("Drinking","How did the Prophet ﷺ drink?","In three breaths, breathing outside the vessel, saying it is more satisfying and wholesome."),
("Drinking","Which drink did the Prophet ﷺ love most?","Something sweet and cool."),
("Perfume","Did the Prophet ﷺ refuse perfume when it was offered?","No, he never refused perfume."),
("His speech","How did the Prophet ﷺ speak?","Clearly and distinctly, so that anyone sitting with him could remember it; not rapidly."),
("His speech","Why did the Prophet ﷺ sometimes repeat a word three times?","So that it would be understood."),
("His laughter","How did the Prophet ﷺ usually laugh?","Mostly by smiling."),
("His character","How did 'A'ishah رضي الله عنها describe the Prophet's ﷺ character?","His character was the Qur'an."),
("His humility","What did the Prophet ﷺ do at home, according to 'A'ishah رضي الله عنها?","He was like any man: he mended his clothes, milked his sheep and served himself."),
("His modesty","How did Abu Sa'id رضي الله عنه describe the Prophet's ﷺ modesty?","He was more modest than a virgin in her seclusion."),
("His generosity","How generous was the Prophet ﷺ?","He never said 'no' to anyone who asked him for something, and he was most generous in Ramadan."),
("His sleep","How did the Prophet ﷺ lie down to sleep?","On his right side, with his right hand under his cheek."),
("His sleep","What did the Prophet ﷺ say when going to sleep?","'O Allah, in Your name I die and I live.'"),
("Waking","What did the Prophet ﷺ say when he woke up?","'Praise be to Allah who gave us life after causing us to die, and to Him is the return.'"),
("Night prayer","Why did the Prophet ﷺ pray at night until his feet swelled?","When asked, he said: 'Should I not be a grateful servant?'"),
("Night prayer","How many rak'ahs did the Prophet ﷺ pray at night, according to 'A'ishah رضي الله عنها?","He did not exceed eleven rak'ahs, in Ramadan or outside it."),
("Duha","Did the Prophet ﷺ pray the Duha prayer?","Yes: four rak'ahs, and sometimes more, as Allah willed."),
("Fasting","Which days of the week did the Prophet ﷺ fast?","Mondays and Thursdays, as deeds are presented to Allah on them."),
("Fasting","In which month, after Ramadan, did the Prophet ﷺ fast the most?","Sha'ban."),
("His worship","How did the Prophet ﷺ recite the Qur'an at night?","Slowly and clearly, letter by letter, pausing at the end of each ayah."),
("His weeping","What happened when Ibn Mas'ud رضي الله عنه recited to the Prophet ﷺ up to 'How will it be when We bring from every nation a witness...'?","The Prophet ﷺ said 'Enough', and his eyes were flowing with tears."),
("His names","Name some of the Prophet's ﷺ names he mentioned himself.","Muhammad, Ahmad, al-Mahi (by whom disbelief is erased), al-Hashir (at whose feet people are gathered) and al-'Aqib (the last)."),
("His age","How old was the Prophet ﷺ when he passed away?","Sixty-three years old."),
("His bed","What was the Prophet's ﷺ bed made of?","Leather stuffed with palm fibre."),
("His living","What did the Prophet ﷺ leave behind when he passed away?","No dinar or dirham, no slave and nothing else except his white mule, his weapons and a piece of land he gave in charity."),
("His seeing in dreams","What did the Prophet ﷺ say about seeing him in a dream?","Whoever sees me in a dream has truly seen me, for Shaytan cannot take my form."),
]
if __name__ == "__main__":
    import json
    cards = [{"id": f"sh{i}", "f": q, "b": a, "s": t, "aw": 1} for i, (t, q, a) in enumerate(Q)]
    json.dump(cards, open("app/data/decks/shamail_qa.json", "w"), ensure_ascii=False, separators=(",", ":")); print("shamail", len(cards))
